# ---docerion
# type: config
# title: Gitignore for the .gemini directory
# summary: Gitignore that excludes everything in .gemini except commands, OWNERS, style settings and selected policy files, so users can add their own policies.
# ---

/*
!.gitignore
!commands/
!OWNERS
!.style.mdformat

# We want to ignore all other policies, to allow users to make their own.
!policies/
/policies/*
!/policies/README.md
!/policies/chromium-deny.toml
